{"abstract":"Object-centric process mining views processes and traces as an interaction between many objects, each with their own life cycle, as opposed to being centred around the concept of a single case. Instead of describing implicit process flows, declarative process modelling focuses on the description of processes as a set of explicit rules or constraints. The declarative Dynamic Condition Response (DCR) Graphs notation has seen wide industry adoption, in particular in the Danish public sector, has seen significant work on the development of methods for the modelling, verification, and enactment of collaborative processes, and has led to the development of the award winning DisCoveR process miner. In this paper we apply object-centric concepts to DCR Graphs modelling and mining, in particular we: (1) show an extension to DCR Graphs that allows capturing of object-centric process relations and (2) introduce a process discovery method for such object-centric DCR Graphs. We showcase these contributions on the BPIC2017 loan application log.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Christfort, Axel K.F.","Rivkin, Andrey","Fahland, Dirk","Hildebrandt, Thomas T.","Slaats, Tijs"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-775297"],"event":{"end":"2024-10-18","place":"Lyngby, dk","start":"2024-10-14","title":"6th International Conference on Process Mining","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Eindhoven University of Technology"],"keyword":["Declarative process models","Dynamic Condition Response Graphs","Object centric","Process alignment","Process discovery","Process mining"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"discovery of object centric declarative models","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85206255737","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-775297","identifier":[{"id":"85206255737","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-4923646c-ce26-420b-a299-70ce14d97811"],"keyword":["Declarative process models","Dynamic Condition Response Graphs","Object-centric","Process alignment","Process discovery","Process mining"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-4-7-0E11061F303597578ED7E6455BA0ABEC"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Software Systems Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"nl","key":"eindhoven university of technology","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Eindhoven University of Technology","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Axel K.F.","key":"christfortpau","last":"Christfort","name":"Christfort, Axel K.F.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andrey","key":"rivkinpau","last":"Rivkin","locid":"95c2ae00-9a29-4dc0-a8fe-efa7a0f7