A.","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Nobuko","key":"yoshidapedh","last":"Yoshida","name":"Yoshida, Nobuko","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-21759-4_8","isbn":["9783030217587"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"129-147","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","title":"Formal Techniques for Distributed Objects, Components, and Systems - 39th IFIP WG 6.1 International Conference, FORTE 2019, held as part of the 14th International Federated Conference on Distributed Computing Techniques, DisCoTec 2019, Proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85067365596"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen","dcr solutions a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-6184f633-0354-4f87-958c-828245aa7345"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Declarative Choreographies and Liveness","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-451792","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Hybrid modeling approaches have been proposed to represent processes that have both strictly regulated parts and loosely regulated parts. Such process is so-called Knowledge-intensive Process (KiP), which is a sequence of activities based on intense knowledge use and acquisition. Due to these very particular characteristics, the first author previously proposed the Knowledge-intensive Process Ontology (KiPO) and its subjacent notation (KiPN). However, KiPN still fails to represent the declarative perspective of a KiP. Therefore, in this paper, we propose to improve KiPN by integrating it with the declarative process modeling language DCR Graphs. DCR-KiPN is a hybrid process modeling notation that combines a declarative process model language (activities and business rules) with the main aspects of a KiP, such as cognitive elements (decision rationale towards goals, beliefs, desires and intentions), interactions and knowledge-exchange among its participants.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Santoro, Flávia","Slaats, Tijs","Hildebrandt, Thomas T.","Baiao, Fernanda"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-545583"],"event":{"acronym":"ER","end":"2019-11-07","place":"Salvador, br","start":"2019-11-04","title":"38th International Conference on Conceptual Modeling, ER 2019","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, South"],"country":["Brazil"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Pontifícia Universidade Católica do Rio de Janeiro","State University of Rio de Janeiro"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dcr kipn a hybrid modeling approach for knowledge intensive processes","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/410854716/DCR_KiPN.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-545583","identifier":[{"id":"85076178467","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-fefe175e-bc05-4056-9842-5f5f6fb9ecad"],"keyword":["Hybrid process notation","Knowledge-intensive Process"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0E93A6E18026CC745902D05F8164C9A1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/410854716/DCR_KiPN.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"br","key":"state university of rio de janeiro","loc":["Brazil","America, South"],"name":"State University of Rio de Janeiro","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Software, Data, People & Society"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"br","key":"pontifícia universidade católica do rio de janeiro","loc":["Brazil","America, South"],"name":"Pontifícia Universidade Católica do Rio de Janeiro","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Flávia","key":"santoropau","last":"Santoro","name":"Santoro, Flávia","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Tijs","key":"slaatspau","last":"Slaats","locid":"85f00008-e9c6-439c-aae5-e5bd725f2099","name":"Slaats, Tijs","orcid":"0000-0001-6244-6970","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Thomas T.","key":"hildebrandtpau","last":"Hildebrandt","locid":"c1d69914-5f7a-4f0b-8ffb-766693004328","name":"Hildebrandt, Thomas T.","orcid":"0000-0002-7435-5563","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Fernanda","key":"baiao