{"abstract":"We present an overview of some recent efforts aimed at the development of Choreographic Programming, a programming paradigm for the production of concurrent software that is guaranteed to be correct by construction from global descriptions of communication behaviour.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Montesi, Fabrizio"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-578931"],"event":{"acronym":"WS-FM","end":"2014-09-12","place":"Eindhoven, nl","start":"2014-09-11","title":"11th International Workshop on Web Services and Formal Methods","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kickstarting choreographic programming","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84964786326","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-578931","identifier":[{"id":"84964786326","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-140e762d-7e3f-4574-ace5-09801a50decb"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4A8B709468927FA5D23D3E43174EAB63"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Science, Department of Mathematics and Computer Science","SDU, Faculty of Science, Department of Mathematics and Computer Science, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fabrizio","key":"montesipau","last":"Montesi","locid":"81d9220c-ba43-48b1-aa21-129c942a9c92","name":"Montesi, Fabrizio","orcid":"0000-0003-4666-901X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Thomas","key":"hildebrandtpedh","last":"Hildebrandt","name":"Hildebrandt, Thomas","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"António","key":"ravarapedh","last":"Ravara","name":"Ravara, António","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jan Martijn","key":"vanderwerfpedh","last":"van der Werf","name":"van der Werf, Jan Martijn","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Matthias","key":"weidlichpedh","last":"Weidlich","name":"Weidlich, Matthias","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-33612-1_1","eisbn":["9783319336121"],"isbn":["9783319336114"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"3-10","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","subtitle":"Proceedings of the 11th International Workshop on Web Services and Formal Methods: Formal Aspects of Service-Oriented and Cloud Computing","title":"Web Services, Formal Methods, and Behavioral Types"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84964786326"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-140e762d-7e3f-4574-ace5-09801a50decb"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Kickstarting Choreographic Programming","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-578931","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"In an effort to understand recent results showing differences between the power conversion efficiencies of lead halide (CH3NH3PbI3-xClx) solar cells on glass versus flexible substrates, this study investigates the influence that substrate and processing methods have on morphological and crystallographic development. Using our in situ slot-die micro roll-to-roll coater setup, we measured small and wide angle X-ray scattering in grazing incidence while the material dried, enabling us to follow the crystallization from just after the deposition and up to 25 minutes later. The data showed differing crystallographic developments between the substrates, especially seen through the behaviour of a crystalline precursor which survived longer on the flexible substrates than on glass. Additionally, the common degradation product PbI2 was absent on the thickest flexible substrate. This leads us to conjecture that the flexible substrates absorb part of the solvent, thereby delaying evaporation and changing the solvent environment around the perovskite. As a further test, we produced solar cells with the same substrates and confirmed that the ones made on flexible substrates performed worse than those made on glass, but that when including an ITO layer in the stack it seemed to act as a buffer, whereby the solar cell performance was improved.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Rossander, Lea Hildebrandt","Larsen-Olsen, Thue Trofod","Dam, Henrik Friis","Schmidt, Thomas Mikael","Corazza, Michael","Norrman, Kion","Rajkovic, Ivan","Andreasen, Jens Wenzel","Krebs, Frederik C"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-307722"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Paul Scherrer Institute"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"i in situ i x ray scattering of perovskite solar cell active layers roll to roll coated on flexible substrates","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84978998654","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-307722","identifier":[{"id":"84978998654","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-0a5bb7f5-fb05-44fe-a7db-3f0a3c2c4a2c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DBE991CC37ED27FF8029261E01CC117F"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage, Functional organic materials"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"ch","key":"paul scherrer institute","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Paul Scherrer Institute","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lea Hildebrandt","key":"rossanderpau","last":"Rossander","locid":"8d6d03ca-8be3-4599-ba6c-2715e2652876","name":"Rossander, Lea Hildebrandt","orcid":"0000-0003-1628-9104","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thue T.","key":"larsenolsenpau","last":"Larsen-Olsen","locid":"e03ae801-6940-4a24-b4a7-b23383928558","name":"Larsen-Olsen, Thue Trofod","name_org":"Larsen-Olsen, Thue T.","orcid":"0000-0001-5373-898X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","