{"abstract":"We present Big Red, a visual editor for bigraphs and bigraphical reactive systems, based upon Eclipse. The editor integrates with several existing bigraph tools to permit simulation and model-checking of bigraphical models. We give a brief introduction to the bigraphs formalism, and show how these concepts manifest within the tool using a small motivating example bigraphical model developed in Big Red.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Faithfull, Alexander John","Perrone, Gian David","Hildebrandt, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384966"],"event":{"end":"2012-09-29","place":"Bremen, de","start":"2012-09-28","title":"The 4th International Workshop on Graph Computation Models","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bigraphs","Editor","Reactive systems"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"big red a development environment for bigraphs","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://gcm2012.imag.fr/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384966","identifier":[{"id":"85032593853","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-fb434896-3020-4174-aaa7-9c13d4821bf8"],"keyword":["bigraphs","editor","reactive systems"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-0F3267A253CA126F690FEBFD8C97216E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://gcm2012.imag.fr/","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["De